# Engineering workflow

- Read PROJECT_SPEC.md, CURSOR_MASTER_PROMPT.md, ROADMAP.md, trading-ai.mdc,
  STATUS.md and the active cursor_tasks/TAI-XXX.md before implementation.
- Inspect branch, git status, latest commit and relevant existing code. Preserve
  owner edits. Work only in this repository; never modify Vendor/BET AI.
- The owner explicitly authorized sequential continuation on 2026-11-15. Execute
  one active task at a time; verify it, write its report and commit before starting
  the next prerequisite-satisfied task. Stop dependent work on unresolved PARTIAL/FAIL. On 2026-11-15 the owner explicitly
  directed resolving TAI-024; the minimal real Android CI prerequisite is authorized
  ahead of TAI-129. Full TAI-129 scope remains pending. The source
  templates' request for a new instruction per task is superseded by that request.
- Keep changes minimal and typed. Do not introduce unrelated refactors. Do not
  reset, force-push, delete volumes/data or amend owner commits without approval.
  Use explicit paths; no real broker credentials in code, fixtures, logs or Git.
- PAPER default. No real orders or LIVE activation authorized. Never synthesize
  evidence for gates, 90-day results, brokers, market-data entitlement or tests.
- Decimal for financial quantities; aware UTC and usable_at; no lookahead.
  Model cannot bypass risk. UNKNOWN blocks create retry until reconciliation.
- Test relevant positive, negative, failure and race cases. Run available lint,
  build and migration checks. Record commands, results, environment limitations
  and artifact paths. Document checks verify documents, not runtime behavior.
- Check staged diff for secrets/unrelated files and whitespace before commit.
  Commit a logical task with its ID. Check post-commit status; do not claim clean
  status without running it. Use Git history for task SHA, avoiding self-reference.
- Update root STATUS.md and docs/reports/TAI-XXX.md. Preserve source task prompts.
  PASS requires executed applicable checks and all acceptance criteria. Missing
  runtime/integration evidence means PARTIAL, with exact recovery action.
- For external API work verify current official documentation before coding;
  fixture tests are not proof of a real broker connection.

## Required report

```text
TASK: TAI-XXX — name
STATUS: PASS | PARTIAL | FAIL
BRANCH / HEAD SHA:
CHANGED FILES:
IMPLEMENTED:
TESTS RUN: command and actual result
SAFETY CHECK: PAPER default; no live calls; no secrets
MIGRATIONS / BREAKING CHANGES:
EVIDENCE:
RISKS / BLOCKERS:
NEXT RECOMMENDED TASK:
```

At a blocking prerequisite, report concrete incomplete work and stop dependent
tasks. Authorization to continue development does not authorize LIVE unlock,
real orders or service purchases. The owner separately authorized upload to
Ggoolldd/trade and public visibility for TAI-024 on 2026-11-15; this does not
authorize deploying services or publishing other repositories.
